innocent citizen against terrorism was a
fundamental priority of civilized nation
before the awful events of September
11th for our part
Canada has already pioneers ways of
our country as a base of operation and
attack including the screening of air
passengers abroad before the flight to
Canada and proposed changes to the
Immigration Act and customs act currently
before Parliament
anticipated many of the security and
